#: src/ui.c:565
msgid "Password Notification"
msgstr ""

#: src/ui.c:568
msgid ""
"Password-notify monitors the expiration of your domain password, checks its "
"status periodically using LDAP and Kerberos authentication, and shows "
"desktop reminders when it is time to change it. The tray menu lets you check "
"the status immediately and change your password using Kerberos or the system "
"passwd/PAM mechanism. The application runs in your graphical session and "
"supports English and Russian."
msgstr ""

